[b]v1.5.0 — Victims tab, export, and a save fix[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Victims tab[/b] in the F6 panel: every race and faction you've killed or knocked out, in two sortable tables. Suggested by az455862.
[*][b]Victims per character[/b]: switch the tab between the whole squad and the selected character. Counted from this version on.
[*][b]Export[/b] button: saves your stats to exports/stats-<date>.txt and .csv (opens in Excel) in the mod folder.
[*][b]Fixed:[/b] saving while a victim was down and loading before it bled out lost the kill. Who knocked each victim down is now kept in the save. Reported by az455862.
[/list]
Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
